Test requested migrations and relocations to a node whose Proxmox VE version
would drop the guest identity, while the source node keeps it.

The expected outcome is:
- The moves of vm:101 and ct:102 to node2 are refused before the services are
  stopped. Both keep running on node1
- The moves of vm:101 and ct:102 to node3, which keeps the guest identity, are
  done as usual
